  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Information Campaign to Deter Potential Irregular Maritime Migration from Indonesia to Australia in 2024-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 12-month project aims to primarily raise awareness on reducing irregular maritime and land movements for Indonesians. The project will focus on broadening public awareness on the hazards of irregular sea travel, the significance of upholding human dignity and safety during migration journeys, and the risks involved in aiding irregular or undocumented migration.</narrative>
  </description>
